{"id":"canyon-chamber","name":"Canyon chamber","type":"location","aliases":["dead end chamber"],"description":"A dead-end chamber in a canyon where Anafenza's last stand takes place.","pages":1,"first_seen":"2015-04-02","last_seen":"2015-04-02","description_citations":[{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"The Guardian","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Ari Levitch"],"date":"2015-04-02","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/guardian-2015-04-02","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/guardian-2015-04-02","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"The Guardian\" by Ari Levitch. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 2 Apr 2015."}],"bio":null,"timeline":[{"id":"guardian-2015-04-02-e1","era":null,"summary":"In the flashback, Oret and Captain Anafenza flee a Kolaghan horde through a canyon after their fortress falls and their lines break.","participants":["oret","anafenza","kolaghan","oret-s-scalelord"],"location":"canyon-chamber","importance":"minor","page":"stories/guardian-2015-04-02","order":458,"story_date":"2015-04-02","storyline":"Dragons of Tarkir","source":"wizards","paragraph":36,"quote":"But here they were, their fortress lost and their lines broken, fleeing for their lives before the bulk of a Kolaghan horde.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/guardian-2015-04-02#:~:text=But%20here%20they%20were%2C,of%20a%20Kolaghan%20horde.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"The Guardian","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Ari Levitch"],"date":"2015-04-02","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/guardian-2015-04-02","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/guardian-2015-04-02#:~:text=But%20here%20they%20were%2C,of%20a%20Kolaghan%20horde.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"The Guardian\" by Ari Levitch. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 2 Apr 2015."}},{"id":"guardian-2015-04-02-e2","era":null,"summary":"A Kolaghan orc kills Oret's ibex with a lightning spear and attacks him; Anafenza kills the orc by drawing out his life with golden-white light.","participants":["oret","anafenza","kolaghan"],"location":"canyon-chamber","importance":"minor","page":"stories/guardian-2015-04-02","order":458,"story_date":"2015-04-02","storyline":"Dragons of Tarkir","source":"wizards","paragraph":49,"quote":"It passed through him, pulling something unseen but vital from him as it passed, leaving him lifeless in the dust.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/guardian-2015-04-02#:~:text=It%20passed%20through%20him%2C,lifeless%20in%20the%20dust.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"The Guardian","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Ari Levitch"],"date":"2015-04-02","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/guardian-2015-04-02","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/guardian-2015-04-02#:~:text=It%20passed%20through%20him%2C,lifeless%20in%20the%20dust.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"The Guardian\" by Ari Levitch. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 2 Apr 2015."}},{"id":"guardian-2015-04-02-e3","era":null,"summary":"Anafenza leads Oret to a kin-tree in a dead-end chamber, revealing that amber vessels and the carved tree anchor ancestor spirits.","participants":["anafenza","oret","kin-tree"],"location":"canyon-chamber","importance":"major","page":"stories/guardian-2015-04-02","order":458,"story_date":"2015-04-02","storyline":"Dragons of Tarkir","source":"wizards","paragraph":62,"quote":"Spirits can be carried in amber, but I believe the tree is their anchor.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/guardian-2015-04-02#:~:text=Spirits%20can%20be%20carried,tree%20is%20their%20anchor.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"The Guardian","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Ari Levitch"],"date":"2015-04-02","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/guardian-2015-04-02","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/guardian-2015-04-02#:~:text=Spirits%20can%20be%20carried,tree%20is%20their%20anchor.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"The Guardian\" by Ari Levitch. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 2 Apr 2015."}},{"id":"guardian-2015-04-02-e4","era":null,"summary":"Gvar Barzeel and dozens of Kolaghan warriors enter the chamber, and Anafenza calls on the tree's ancestors.","participants":["gvar-barzeel","anafenza","kolaghan","kin-tree"],"location":"canyon-chamber","importance":"major","page":"stories/guardian-2015-04-02","order":458,"story_date":"2015-04-02","storyline":"Dragons of Tarkir","source":"wizards","paragraph":71,"quote":"Spirits of this tree, ancestors of my people, your descendants need you.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/guardian-2015-04-02#:~:text=Spirits%20of%20this%20tree%2C,your%20descendants%20need%20you.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"The Guardian","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Ari Levitch"],"date":"2015-04-02","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/guardian-2015-04-02","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/guardian-2015-04-02#:~:text=Spirits%20of%20this%20tree%2C,your%20descendants%20need%20you.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"The Guardian\" by Ari Levitch. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 2 Apr 2015."}},{"id":"guardian-2015-04-02-e5","era":null,"summary":"Anafenza merges with the ancestor spirits and kills Gvar and his entire warband.","participants":["anafenza","gvar-barzeel","kolaghan"],"location":"canyon-chamber","importance":"major","page":"stories/guardian-2015-04-02","order":458,"story_date":"2015-04-02","storyline":"Dragons of Tarkir","source":"wizards","paragraph":79,"quote":"Gvar, the shamans, all of the Kolaghan raiders—they didn't stand a chance.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/guardian-2015-04-02#:~:text=Gvar%2C%20the%20shamans%2C%20all,didn%27t%20stand%20a%20chance.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"The Guardian","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Ari Levitch"],"date":"2015-04-02","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/guardian-2015-04-02","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/guardian-2015-04-02#:~:text=Gvar%2C%20the%20shamans%2C%20all,didn%27t%20stand%20a%20chance.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"The Guardian\" by Ari Levitch. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 2 Apr 2015."}},{"id":"guardian-2015-04-02-e6","era":null,"summary":"A dragon of Kolaghan's brood dives at Anafenza and is torn apart by a bolt of golden light made of spirits, while the rest flee.","participants":["anafenza","kolaghan"],"location":"canyon-chamber","importance":"major","page":"stories/guardian-2015-04-02","order":458,"story_date":"2015-04-02","storyline":"Dragons of Tarkir","source":"wizards","paragraph":82,"quote":"They moved as a massive bolt of golden light, and at its advance the dragon tried to reverse course.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/guardian-2015-04-02#:~:text=They%20moved%20as%20a,tried%20to%20reverse%20course.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"The Guardian","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Ari Levitch"],"date":"2015-04-02","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/guardian-2015-04-02","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/guardian-2015-04-02#:~:text=They%20moved%20as%20a,tried%20to%20reverse%20course.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"The Guardian\" by Ari Levitch. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 2 Apr 2015."}},{"id":"guardian-2015-04-02-e7","era":null,"summary":"Oret's scalelord lands in the chamber, crushing the kin-tree and learning of Anafenza's necromancy.","participants":["oret-s-scalelord","anafenza","oret","kin-tree"],"location":"canyon-chamber","importance":"major","page":"stories/guardian-2015-04-02","order":458,"story_date":"2015-04-02","storyline":"Dragons of Tarkir","source":"wizards","paragraph":96,"quote":"their scalelord descended into the chamber where, beneath its great weight, the ancient tree fell to splinters.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/guardian-2015-04-02#:~:text=their%20scalelord%20descended%20into,tree%20fell%20to%20splinters.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"The Guardian","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Ari Levitch"],"date":"2015-04-02","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/guardian-2015-04-02","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/guardian-2015-04-02#:~:text=their%20scalelord%20descended%20into,tree%20fell%20to%20splinters.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"The Guardian\" by Ari Levitch. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 2 Apr 2015."}},{"id":"guardian-2015-04-02-e8","era":null,"summary":"Oret asks his scalelord to let him execute Anafenza himself, and the dragon agrees.","participants":["oret","oret-s-scalelord","anafenza"],"location":"canyon-chamber","importance":"major","page":"stories/guardian-2015-04-02","order":458,"story_date":"2015-04-02","storyline":"Dragons of Tarkir","source":"wizards","paragraph":103,"quote":"Please, my scalelord, allow me to be the one to execute her.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/guardian-2015-04-02#:~:text=Please%2C%20my%20scalelord%2C%20allow,one%20to%20execute%20her.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"The Guardian","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Ari Levitch"],"date":"2015-04-02","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/guardian-2015-04-02","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/guardian-2015-04-02#:~:text=Please%2C%20my%20scalelord%2C%20allow,one%20to%20execute%20her.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"The Guardian\" by Ari Levitch. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 2 Apr 2015."}},{"id":"guardian-2015-04-02-e9","era":null,"summary":"Oret beheads Anafenza as she kneels, whispering that it is not the end.","participants":["oret","anafenza"],"location":"canyon-chamber","importance":"major","page":"stories/guardian-2015-04-02","order":458,"story_date":"2015-04-02","storyline":"Dragons of Tarkir","source":"wizards","paragraph":108,"quote":"This is not the end,\" he whispered to his captain.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/guardian-2015-04-02#:~:text=This%20is%20not%20the,whispered%20to%20his%20captain.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"The Guardian","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Ari Levitch"],"date":"2015-04-02","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/guardian-2015-04-02","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/guardian-2015-04-02#:~:text=This%20is%20not%20the,whispered%20to%20his%20captain.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"The Guardian\" by Ari Levitch. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 2 Apr 2015."}}],"relations":[],"pages_say":[{"page":"stories/guardian-2015-04-02","order":458,"story_date":"2015-04-02","presence":"appears","source":"wizards","description":"A dead-end chamber in a canyon where Anafenza's last stand takes place.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"The Guardian","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Ari Levitch"],"date":"2015-04-02","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/guardian-2015-04-02","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/guardian-2015-04-02","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"The Guardian\" by Ari Levitch. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 2 Apr 2015."}}]}
